  <h2>What this is</h2>
  <p>
    Health literacy is a Motivate category because knowledge changes behavior in ways that
    willpower alone cannot. When you understand <em>why</em> protein matters, <em>why</em>
    sleep drives recovery, <em>why</em> the gut connects to the brain — the habits become
    obvious rather than forced. The 4M framework is designed to be understood, not just followed.
  </p>
  <p>
    My4MLife delivers health education through two channels: the My4MLife App (weekly
    educational content tied to the current protocol phase) and the blog (longer-form
    deep dives on topics relevant to men). Both are shaped under Dr. TJ's guidance —
    by an assembled team of clinicians and researchers — to be accessible,
    evidence-grounded, and directly actionable.
  </p>
  <p>The MindSpan Score turns that knowledge into feedback — a single 0–100 number in the app that moves when you apply what you've learned, and moves back when you don't.</p>

